<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://damonacook.com/wp-trend-watcher-wordpress-trends-ai-workflow/">You Don’t Need a Fancy AI Setup to Stay Current With WordPress</a> &#8211; Damons post about why he built WP Trend Watcher and how to install it</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://colorful-tones.github.io/wp-trend-watcher/">Recent &#8220;editions&#8221; of WP Trend Watcher</a></p>
